	quest.782A8F5006E367E0.title: "&a仪式用品"
	quest.78337B57A6D6AC08.quest_desc: [
		"&eSilent Gear&r is a mod centered around creating custom tools and armor for every step of your playthrough."
		""
		"To get started, you'll need to create the framework for making your own tools and armor."
		""
		"[\"In \", {\"text\": \"FTB Skies 2\", \"color\": \"gold\"}, \", you can only craft tool parts via the \", { \"text\": \"Productive Metalworks Foundry\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1B8BB733ADF897FE\" }, \"hoverEvent\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"contents\": \"Go to Foundry Quest\"} }, \", but some tools can still only be assembled using Templates or Blueprints.\"]"
		""
		"Templates are one time use and Blueprints are infinite."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"To craft a Template Board, you'll need to make a &3Stone Anvil&r first."
